  "ingredients": [
    "2 large avocado",
    "1 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk",
    "1/2 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1/2 cup unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 cup erythritol (powdered)",
    "25 drop liquid stevia",
    "1 1/2 ounce unsweetened baking chocolate"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Cut the avocados in half, remove seed, then scoop out the avocado flesh into a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_85091.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add coconut milk, heavy cream, and the vanilla extract. Use an immersion blender to blend this mixture together until smooth and creamy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_8516.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a spice grinder, grind the erythritol until powdered. Let settle before removing lid. Add erythritol, liquid stevia, and cocoa powder to the creamy avocado mixture and mix again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_85251.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the mixture is smooth, chop 6 squares of unsweetened baker's chocolate and add into the bowl. Use a spoon or fork to fold the chocolate in.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_85341.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave the bowl in the refrigerator for 6-12 hours to completely cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_8543.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "About 15-20 minutes before you want to serve, assemble your ice cream machine and follow the instructions as per manufacturers notes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_8553.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can store this in the freezer afterwards for a few hours to harden, or you can immediately serve for a soft-serve feel. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-chunk-avocado-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-51233-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
